\label{Th:Main1-Existence}
Suppose that (G1)--(G5) are satisfied. 
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(a)] There exists a nontrivial solution $u_0 \in X^1 (\mathbb{R}^N)$ of
\begin{equation}\label{eq:main}
